      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Lovely starter home in the heart of Kinvara for just 295,000 </li><li> Located at the end of row of just 4 homes in a quiet cul de sac </li><li> Large lounge with picture size window, solid wood flooring & inlaid solid fuel fireplace </li><li> Kitchen & dining area extend the full width of the property with doors to rear gardens </li><li> Dining area comes with solid fuel stove - very warm. </li><li> BER is a C with potential to upgrade to A (see advisory report) </li><li> Two double bedrooms & one roomy single bedroom </li><li> Exceptionally spacious rear gardens with ample opportunity to extend (SPP) </li><li> Large communal green area in the development - great for safe outdoor play </li><li> Mere minutes walk to the bustling & thriving village of Kinvara</li></ul>"
      },
